        "ScenePath": "assembly:/_pro/scenes/missions/marrakesh/_scene_spider.entity",
        "TileImage": "$($repository 20fe3a6e-2274-4098-9247-91a74c8fe03f).Image",
        "Description": "First soldier is killed by the phone, the second by the current near the puddle. The guy in the hooded bathrobe is killed by smoking near an explosive barrel. The first girl is killed by smoking in inappropriate places too (either the first motorcycle or the second one, throw a coin if needed), the second girl by current through the puddle near the wending machine close to the lamp seller. Hope this contract helps those who struggle with the challenge.",
